WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.124
Unit twelve. My Neighborhood!

2
00:00:04.088 --> 00:00:12.313
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Elementary level!

3
00:00:12.363 --> 00:00:17.139
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.189 --> 00:00:20.850
Today we learn: My Neighborhood. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:25.023
Neighbor. Say it with me. Neighbor!

6
00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:32.430
Street. Say it with me. Street!

7
00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:40.051
Community. Say it with me. Community!

8
00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:47.034
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

9
00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:54.024
Quiet. Say it with me. Quiet!

10
00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:02.180
Convenience store. Say it with me. Convenience store!

11
00:01:05.746 --> 00:01:09.880
Nearby. Say it with me. Nearby!

12
00:01:13.315 --> 00:01:16.799
Friendly. Say it with me. Friendly!

13
00:01:20.326 --> 00:01:23.843
Resident. Say it with me. Resident!

14
00:01:27.312 --> 00:01:31.296
Helpful. Say it with me. Helpful!

15
00:01:34.778 --> 00:01:45.803
Grammar time! There is / are + adjective. Listen. There is a friendly community. It is quiet and safe.

16
00:01:45.853 --> 00:01:52.760
Your turn. Say it with me. There is a friendly community. It is quiet and safe.

17
00:01:57.829 --> 00:02:06.651
My neighbor lives on a quiet street near a convenience store. Our community feels safe and friendly, and everything I need is nearby.

18
00:02:06.701 --> 00:02:08.159
I like this story!

19
00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:14.523
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:14.573 --> 00:02:15.723
Community!

21
00:02:16.797 --> 00:02:22.104
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:22.154 --> 00:02:23.304
Nearby!

23
00:02:24.294 --> 00:02:31.958
Think and answer. What do you like about your neighborhood?

24
00:02:32.008 --> 00:02:33.158
Great answer!

25
00:02:34.218 --> 00:02:38.439
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:38.489 --> 00:02:40.012
Goodbye, everyone!

